  "body": "G.J. Gardner Homes House and Land Package featuring a Custom design.\r\n\r\nThis amazing grand home has everything you ever wanted. With its large open plan kitchen, dining and living area opening out onto a stunning backyard with perfect indoor/outdoor flow for everyone. There are two separate lounges/media rooms with a large master retreat and another 4 bedrooms with enough space for everyone. Beautiful void in the main entrance to provide additional height and light. Stunning views of Long Bay. Close to Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay college, Long Bay beach, Long Bay Surf Club and a great local community. Be quick, this won't last\r\n\r\nYour plan, our plans, or we can design from scratch. For more information visit our website http://www.gjgardner.co.nz\r\nMORE NEW ZEALANDERS TRUST G.J. GARDNER TO BUILD THEIR HOMES THAN ANY OTHER BUILDER.\r\n\r\nIf you’re thinking about building, make Home Prep the first step in your journey. It’s our essential step-by-step guide to the building process. Full of independent advice and handy information to help you have a great building experience. Get your free copy from gjgardner.co.nz today.\r\n\r\n*Price is an indication only and includes land. Some conditions may apply. Image is artist’s impression only.\r\n\r\nCopyright G.J. Gardner Homes",
